   "script_line": "There is a temptation in this unit, and it is worth naming: because the register is more informal, it is easy to let the standard slide with it. They are not the same thing. Informal means no linen tablecloth and no formal address. It does not mean a badly washed glass, a toilet nobody is checking, or a twenty-minute wait with nobody saying anything. The register changes; the standard does not. If you keep one line from this module, keep that one.",
