   "segment_window": "1:14–1:51",
   "seconds": 7,
   "script_line": "And there is something the bar team needs to see clearly: to anyone walking off that beach and into the bar, you are Craveiral. Many of those people have never slept on the farm and perhaps never will. That glass, that plate, that good morning is the only sample of the brand they will get. A good hour in that bar sells room nights we will never be able to attribute to anyone. A bad hour closes doors we never knew we closed.",
